### Health Check
GET https://localhost:7xxx/api/agent/health

### Query 1: General Knowledge
POST https://localhost:7xxx/api/agent/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What is the height of Burj Khalifa?"
}

### Query 2: Recent Events
POST https://localhost:7xxx/api/agent/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Who won the Nobel Prize in Physics in 2024?"
}

### Query 3: Business Information
POST https://localhost:7xxx/api/agent/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Find details about Neil Moodie Studio located at postal code E1 6EA - what is their business model?"
}

### Query 4: Technology
POST https://localhost:7xxx/api/agent/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What are the latest developments in quantum computing?"
}

### Query 5: Travel Information
POST https://localhost:7xxx/api/agent/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What are the top restaurants in Paris according to recent reviews?"
}

### Error Case: Empty Query
POST https://localhost:7xxx/api/agent/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": ""
}
